From e3b652948d7462e20a03a7eba9a192b9d3c34a40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:38:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 42/42] Training items: mints, EV-lowering berries, Power items
 and Bottle Caps

Goldenrod Department Store sells the six EV-lowering berries (3F, from the
start, P500), the six Power items (4F, from four badges, P5,000), the 21 nature
mints (5F, from four badges, P5,000) and the Bottle Cap and Gold Bottle Cap (5F,
from eight badges, P20,000 and P60,000). Bottle Caps are used from the bag on a
Pokemon: the Gold Bottle Cap makes every IV 31, the Bottle Cap the lowest. Made
by tools/hack/training_items.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEYSk2h6k1E1jWo3cHd
